B) 他的妻子欣赏他的努力，喜欢他的画\nC) 他在画画时犯了错并且很在意\nD) 他的妻子欣赏他的努力，即使发现了他的错误","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908395467644327,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8fbd6006945d280affd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369787453,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:07","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"69d91d0c9d9a4b8bbdb34349fdfc5ee2"}